01:06:19.800 --> 01:06:21.860
I'm afraid it's not a very pleasant one for you,

01:06:22.060 --> 01:06:23.980
but will you allow me to ask your pardon?

01:06:24.200 --> 01:06:26.600
And would you be good enough to put me down?

01:06:28.920 --> 01:06:29.080
No.

01:06:30.030 --> 01:06:35.430
My dear Mr. Scroogey, are you serious? Around 100 years, and not of farthingness, not of farthingness.

01:06:35.690 --> 01:06:38.130
I'm afraid there are many back payments included in it.

01:06:38.130 --> 01:06:39.670
My dear Mr. Scroogey.

01:06:39.730 --> 01:06:40.610
You come round and see me?

01:06:40.850 --> 01:06:42.870
We will, we will, we will.

01:06:42.890 --> 01:06:45.050
Thank you, thank you, thank you.

01:06:45.390 --> 01:06:46.450
Bless you, gentlemen.

01:06:47.090 --> 01:06:47.670
Bless you.

01:06:49.360 --> 01:06:51.000
Who's that won't come and dine with you?

01:06:51.140 --> 01:06:52.060
Uncle Scrooge.

01:06:53.720 --> 01:06:56.480
Still, what's the consequence? He won't lose much of a dinner.

01:06:57.320 --> 01:06:59.970
Indeed. Well, I think he'll lose a very good dinner.

01:07:00.000 --> 01:07:00.220
I don't know.

01:07:31.500 --> 01:07:32.860
Can I see him, my love?

01:07:33.890 --> 01:07:36.050
He's in the dining room, sir. I'll show you him.

01:07:36.330 --> 01:07:38.580
He knows me. He knows me.

01:07:39.060 --> 01:07:41.900
Sit there.

01:07:54.610 --> 01:07:55.010
Fred.

01:07:55.750 --> 01:07:56.610
Yes, my soul.

01:07:56.790 --> 01:07:57.300
Who this?

01:07:58.700 --> 01:07:59.380
It is I.

01:08:00.410 --> 01:08:07.380
Dear Uncle Scrooge, I've come to dinner. Will you let me in, Fred?

01:08:08.150 --> 01:08:11.600
Uncle Scrooge? Can't be. Will I?

01:08:12.810 --> 01:08:18.440
A Merry Christmas to you, Uncle. Come in. Come in and join us.

01:08:23.630 --> 01:08:26.640
Welcome, Uncle. And a Merry Christmas.

01:08:27.040 --> 01:08:29.890
Thank you, my dear. A Merry Christmas.

01:08:30.000 --> 01:08:32.270
to you all. Merry Christmas.

01:09:06.300 --> 01:09:08.930
It's late for the office, Bob. It's nearly 9 o'clock.

01:09:09.530 --> 01:09:12.090
Promise Mr. Scrooge you'll be earlier than usual this morning.

01:09:12.530 --> 01:09:13.990
So I did. So I did.

01:09:17.720 --> 01:09:26.540
Goodbye, my darling.

01:09:30.570 --> 01:09:30.730
Thank you.

01:10:21.070 --> 01:10:24.420
Very sorry, sir. I am behind my time.

01:10:24.880 --> 01:10:26.960
I think you are, sir. I think you are.

01:10:27.600 --> 01:10:29.960
One thing or the other, sir, it shan't be repeated.

01:10:30.000 --> 01:10:33.150
I was making rather merry yesterday, sir.

01:10:33.590 --> 01:10:35.430
So I'll tell you what it is me find for her.

01:10:35.870 --> 01:10:37.610
I'm not going to stand it any longer.

01:10:39.920 --> 01:10:43.400
And therefore, therefore,

01:10:44.120 --> 01:10:46.930
I'm going to raise your ster...

01:10:49.230 --> 01:10:51.250
for more serious and all my life, Father.

01:10:51.550 --> 01:10:52.870
I'm going to raise your salary,

01:10:52.870 --> 01:10:54.530
and as with tiny things,

01:10:54.940 --> 01:10:56.740
I'll be a second father to you.

01:10:57.170 --> 01:10:58.610
God, thank you, sir.

01:10:58.830 --> 01:10:59.840
No more, Father.

01:11:02.810 --> 01:11:04.750
They've been wanting you today, Bob. They've been wanting you today.

01:11:05.980 --> 01:11:07.180
Merry Christmas, Bob.

01:11:09.210 --> 01:11:14.380
Merry Christmas, my good fellow, that I've given you for many a year.

01:11:16.830 --> 01:11:17.290
Go on now.

01:11:30.160 --> 01:11:31.280
This is everyone.
